WEBVTT

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:04.000
This exercise is for spinal extension.

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:07.041
Working the muscles in the back.

00:00:06.375 --> 00:00:11.458
Go ahead and center your ball in front of your body and lean into the ball.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.625
So, the ball should be just up above your pelvis.

00:00:14.916 --> 00:00:18.750
Digging your hipbones into the ball.

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:22.291
Bring your hands to the back of your head.

00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:25.875
Or, if you want, you can bring your hands out here.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:29.291
Gently touching the back of your head.

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:34.458
Head is in line with the spine.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.541
Take a nice inhale and exhale come back.

00:00:35.625 --> 00:00:38.250
Closing the ribcage to protect your back.

00:00:37.291 --> 00:00:39.250
Inhale.

00:00:38.416 --> 00:00:41.208
Come forward to stretch out the back.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.125
Exhale.

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:42.541
Come back.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:46.250
Closing the ribcage.

00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:48.083
Inhale.

00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:49.375
Forward.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.833
Exhale.

00:00:51.166 --> 00:00:52.833
Back.

00:00:51.958 --> 00:00:56.166
And, inhale.

00:00:55.416 --> 00:00:57.208
Forward.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:01:01.416
And, when you are done, go ahead and stretch over the ball.

00:01:01.958 --> 00:01:03.833
Hug it.

00:01:07.041 --> 00:01:17.291
Separating the scapula to release those muscles in your back.
